menuconfig IQS9150_EV02_DRIVER
    bool "IQS9150 EV02 sensor driver"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_AZOTEQ_IQS9150_ENABLED
    select I2C
    help
      Initialize IQS9150 EV02 on the active-low RDY interrupt, then publish
      normalized absolute contact frames. Pointer and gesture policies are
      implemented by separate Travelers Pad function modules.

if IQS9150_EV02_DRIVER

config IQS9150_CONTACT_DIAGNOSTICS
    bool "Trace sensor contact flags before normalization"
    default n
    help
      Observe already-read sensor reports on count/slot-mask transitions and
      once per second while contacts remain present. No extra I2C reads are
      performed. Disable after diagnosis to reduce serial logging overhead.

module = IQS9150_EV02_DRIVER
module-str = iqs9150_ev02_driver
source "subsys/logging/Kconfig.template.log_config"

endif
